The '''Manda Merchant Run'''<ref name="RO World Locations" /> or '''Manda Merchant Route'''<ref name="Scarif">{{EncyclopediaCite|Scarif and Other Planets in the Outer Rim}} </ref> was a [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]]<ref name="RO World Locations" /> that ran from [[Bothawui]] in the [[Mid Rim Territories]] southwest to [[Manda]] and ending at [[Molavar]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Map" />

